> REVIEW: Unspecified amount: Salt + pepper

== Ingredients ==

Gather the following ingredients: @chicken breast or thighs{3/10%lb}, @white rice{3/10%cup} (dry), @black beans{2/5%can} (can size 15 oz ea; drained), @corn{1/5%cup}, @avocados{2/5}, @pico de gallo{1/5%cup}, @cheddar{1/5%cup} (shredded), @sour cream{1/10%cup}, @olive oil{2/5%tbsp}, @chili powder{2/5%tsp}, @cumin{1/5%tsp}, @paprika{1/5%tsp}, @lime{1/5}, @cilantro{1/20%cup}, @Salt + pepper{}.

== Preparation ==

Cook rice and warm the beans and corn. Season chicken with chili powder, cumin and paprika and cook fully in olive oil. Slice and serve over rice with vegetables, cheese, sour cream, lime and cilantro.
